<p>Your P2P Ad has a low remaining balance that requires your attention.</p>

<table
    width='100%'
    cellpadding='10'
    cellspacing='0'
    style='background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #eeeeee;'
>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Ad Type</td>
        <td style='font-weight: bold; text-align: right;'>{{adType}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Currency</td>
        <td style='font-weight: bold; text-align: right;'>{{currency}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Exchange Rate</td>
        <td
            style='font-weight: bold; text-align: right; font-size: 18px;'
        >₦{{price}}/{{currency}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Remaining Amount</td>
        <td style='text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #ff9800;'>{{currency}}
            {{remainingAmount}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Minimum Limit</td>
        <td style='text-align: right;'>{{currency}} {{minLimit}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Status</td>
        <td style='text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #4caf50;'>ACTIVE</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p
    style='margin-top: 20px; padding: 10px; background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; font-size: 14px;'
>
    <strong>Action Required:</strong><br />
    Your remaining balance ({{currency}}
    {{remainingAmount}}) is below your minimum limit ({{currency}}
    {{minLimit}}). This means no new orders can be placed on this ad.
</p>

<p style='margin-top: 15px;'>
    <strong>What should I do?</strong><br />
    You have two options:
</p>

<ul style='margin-left: 20px;'>
    <li>Reduce your minimum limit to match the remaining amount</li>
    <li>Close the ad if you no longer wish to trade</li>
</ul>

<div style='margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;'>
    <a
        href='{{dashboardUrl}}'
        style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background-color: #2196f3; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;'
    >
        Manage Ad
    </a>
</div>